{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生ドルでした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントもありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/05/20/9198532/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のゲストさんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アリスインアリスさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/05/20/9198532/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高橋明日香さん、花梨さん、綾乃彩さん、鶴田葵さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アリスインアリスさんが生ドルに\n降臨してくださいました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっそく\n「降臨」使わせてもらいました(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コラボさせていただいたけど\nみなさんかっこよかったな～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/05/20/9198532/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コラボありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"解脱！！` ･ω･ ´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラブアンドロイドさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/05/20/9198532/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らんちゃそさん、ののさん\nsena.さん、ももこさん、藤堂ラナさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きなラブアンドロイドさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生ドルに呼びたいですって言ったら\n本当に次の月に呼んでいただけるとか\nとても幸せ者です(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださってありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワンマン行けなくて悔しかったんだけど\n共演させていただけて嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/05/20/9198532/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"THE ポッシボーさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/05/20/9198532/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"諸塚香奈実さん、橋本愛奈さん\n岡田ロビン翔子さん、秋山ゆりかさん、後藤夕貴さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生ドル2回目の出演のポッシボーさん\nまた来てくださってありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり、\nめちゃくちゃ面白かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/05/20/9198532/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面白いポッシボーさんとしか出来ない企画を\nやろうとするから\nポッシボーさんとの回は\nむちゃぶり企画が多いですね(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にいつもすみません(´･_･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい回でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/05/20/9198532/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから\nタイムシフトやPigooで見てくださる方は\nお楽しみに～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}